<h1>{{title}}</h1>

<p>
MEMOIR is a compiler intermediate representation for data collections (list, set, map).
MEMOIR is in single static assignment (SSA) form, making static analysis both simple and cheap to compute.
By decoupling the logical organization of data from its memory layout, MEMOIR enables the compiler to perform novel memory optimizations.
</p>

